      "question": "If 'X' means '+', 'Y' means '-', 'Z' means 'x', and 'W' means '&divide;' what is the value of the following expression? 15 W 3 X 2 Y 4=?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If &#39;X&#39; means &#39;+&#39;, &#39;Y&#39; means &#39;-&#39;, &#39;Z&#39; means &#39;x&#39;, and &#39;W&#39; means &#39;&divide;&#39;</p>\n\n<p>what is the value of the following expression?</p>\n\n<p><strong>15 W 3 X 2 Y 4=?</strong></p>\n",
