      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">15 W 3 X 2 Y 4=? ⇒ 15 <span style=\"text-align: center;\">÷</span> 3 + 2 - 4=? ⇒ <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">15 </span></u><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\">÷</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> 3</span></u> + 2 - 4=? ⇒ <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">5</span></u><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> + 2</span></u> - 4=? ⇒ 7 - 4=? ⇒ 3 = ?</p>\n",
